{"id": "95296", "title": "重庆师范大学大学城校区2026年附属工程项目道路管网改造工程（第一批）", "sourceUrl": "https://www.cqggzy.com/trade/014001/0315202e-06af-4d01-a92d-28b1116e1584?categoryNum=014001001002", "date": "2026-06-29", "source": "重庆公共资源交易中心", "content": "<div><p><span>2.1 建设地点：</span><u><span>重庆师范大学大学城校区内。</span></u></p>\n<p><span>2.2 项目概况与建设规模：</span><u><span>本项目位于重庆师范大学大学城校区内，管网改造主要位于学生公寓嘉风苑、清风苑等区域；路面改造主要位于学生公寓清风苑、惠风苑、雅风苑等区域；雨水篦子更换主要位于主干公路区域。</span></u></p>\n<p><span>2.3 本次招标项目合同估算金额：</span><u><span>98.44</span></u><u><span>万元。</span></u></p>\n<p><span>2.4 招标范围：</span><u><span>本工程主要包含学生公寓嘉风苑北侧至和风苑加压泵房给水管网改造；清风苑A、B、C栋给水管网改造；清风苑、惠风苑、雅风苑学生公寓路面改造；主干公路雨水篦子更换。具体详见招标人提供的施工图及工程量清单。</span></u></p>\n<p><span>2.5 工期要求：</span><u><span>120日历天，其中学生公寓周边管网</span></u><u><span>及路面</span></u><u><span>改造需在8月20日前竣工并交付使用。</span></u></p>\n<p><span>    缺陷责任期要求：</span><u><span>24个月。</span></u></p></div>", "html": "", "method": "", "region": "重庆", "buyer": "重庆师范大学", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [{"url": "https://www.cqggzy.com/uploadFiles/%E9%87%8D%E5%BA%86%E5%B8%82%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E7%BD%91%E6%96%B0%E7%89%88%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C.pdf", "name": "%E9%87%8D%E5%BA%86%E5%B8%82%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E7%BD%91%E6%96%B0%E7%89%88%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C.pdf", "ext": "pdf", "local_file": "95296__E9_87_8D_E5_BA_86_E5_B8_82_E5_85_AC_E5_85_B1_E8_B5_84_E6_BA_90_E4_BA_A4_E6_98_93_E7_BD_91_E6_96_B0_"}, {"url": "https://fgw.fujian.gov.cn/ztzl/cjzxjyzx/", "name": "attachment", "ext": "download", "local_file": "95296__E9_87_8D_E5_BA_86_E5_B8_82_E5_85_AC_E5_85_B1_E8_B5_84_E6_BA_90_E4_BA_A4_E6_98_93_E7_BD_91_E6_96_B0_"}, {"url": "https://ggzydl.cqggzy.com/CQTPBidder/jsgcztbmis2/pages/zbfilelingqu_hy/cQZBFileDownAttachAction.action?cmd=download&AttachGuid=338c1754-7478-4390-9d90-181fc8be94ff&code=CQ007&tradeGuid=0315202e-06af-4d01-a92d-28b1116e1584", "name": "338c1754", "ext": "download", "local_file": "95296__E9_87_8D_E